  "id": "glabrous-skin",
  "term": "glabrous skin",
  "definition": "Glabrous skin is the skin surface of the hand examined in touch research as vibrations move across it during contact with textures or tools. In this sensory context, it helps spread vibration signals to tactile receptors, shaping how fine surface features and distal events are perceived.",
